        <h1>Privacy Policy for OmniPlayer</h1>
        <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> May 25, 2026</p>

        <p>Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>OmniPlayer</strong> collects, uses, and protects your information when you use our application.</p>

        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>OmniPlayer is designed to function primarily offline with minimal data collection:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Device Media Access:</strong> The app requires permission to access your local storage to list and play your MP3 and video files. These files are processed <strong>strictly on your device</strong> and are never uploaded to our servers or shared with third parties.</li>
            <li><strong>Internet & Radio Services:</strong> To provide internet radio streaming, the app connects to external radio stations. Your listening habits or preferences are not stored or tracked by us.</li>
            <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> We may collect non-identifying technical data (such as crash logs) solely to improve the app's performance and stability.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. Use of Information</h2>
        <p>We use the gathered information solely to ensure the app's core functionalities—such as media playback and radio streaming—work correctly and to provide a seamless user experience.</p>

        <h2>3. Data Sharing</h2>
        <p>We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We do not track your activity for advertising purposes.</p>

        <h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>Our app provides access to third-party internet radio streams. Please be aware that these services are governed by their own privacy policies. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of these external providers.</p>

        <h2>5. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>OmniPlayer does not knowingly collect personal information from children under the age of 13. If we discover that such information has been collected, we will take steps to delete it immediately.</p>

        <h2>6. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by updating the "Last Updated" date on this page.</p>

        <h2>7. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:</p>
        <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:nexusgamesjd@gmail.com">nexusgamesjd@gmail.com</a></p>
